@label kitchen
@set v07_washed
NARRATOR: Cold water. The tap squeaks.
  ta: Kulirndha thanni. Tap "kreech"-nu saththam podudhu.
RAGUL (thinking): A boy she barely knows, alone in the house, and she says "I'm going for a bath"...! (He grins.) ...Chai! Wrong! Wrong!
  ta: Yaarne theriyadha paiyan irukum-bodhu, "kulichitu varan"-na sonna..! Adhuvum veetla yaarum illa-dha nerathula… chai! Thappu! Thappu!
@done
@fx fade_out
@scene gen:interrogation
@fx fade_in
@music standoff
NARRATOR: 7:00 PM. The interrogation room: small, no windows, cracked walls, a single bulb. An inspector sits across from Nithish and slides a file over. Photos of the victims spill out.
  ta: Raathiri 7:00. Visaaranai arai: chinnadhu, jannal illa, vedippu suvar, oru bulb. Oru inspector Nithish munnaadi ukkandhu oru file-a thallaraar. Victims photo-ellam sidharudhu.
NITHISH (thinking): He thinks I know something about these deaths. But I don't. Dhanasree... no. I can't drag her into this. What happens to her life? If her father finds out...
  ta: Yenakku indha saavu pathi yedachu theriyum-nu nenaikuraru. Aana illa. Dhanasree… Illa, avala naan idhukulla kondu vara kudadhu. Ava vaazhkai yenna aguradhu… avunga appa-vuku therinja avlodhan.
