@label tv
@set v07_tv
@done
RAGUL (thinking): It's been ages since I watched TV. They say there's even anime on now...
  ta: TV paathey romba naal aachu, anime-lam kooda podranganu kelvi patten.
@music flashmob
NARRATOR: A music channel. The song Dhanasree danced to at the fest.
  ta: Oru music channel. Fest-la Dhanasree aadina paatu.
RAGUL (thinking): This is her song...
  ta: Idhu Dhanasree dance aaduna paatu…
NARRATOR: The memory pulls him in: her smile, the music moving through her. He isn't sure if it was the dance, or just her. His lips curl into a small smile.
  ta: Andha nyabagam avana izhukudhu: aval sirippu, aval udambula odura isai. Adhu dance-ah, illa aval-ah, theriyala. Avan udhattula oru chinna sirippu.
NARRATOR: Before he knows it, he's dancing. Badly, but with everything he has.
  ta: Theriyaamaiye aada aarambichuttaan. Mosama, aana muzhu manasoda.
DHANASREE (happy): Why'd you stop? You're good.
  ta: Yen nippatita? Nalla dhaan-a aadura.
RAGUL: N-no, that's enough.
  ta: illa podhum.
NARRATOR: He snatches the remote and flips to a news channel. His eyes are still on her.
  ta: Remote-a pudungi news channel-ku maathuraan. Kann innum aval mela dhaan.
@music none
NEWS: In Tamil Nadu, over the last few days, mysterious deaths...
  ta: Tamil Nadu-la kadandha sila naatkalaaga marmamaana...
NARRATOR: Her smile fades. Her eyes go to the clock on the wall. 8:15 PM. Her fists clench.
  ta: Aval sirippu marayudhu. Suvar-la irukura gadigaaram-a paakura. Raathiri 8:15. Kai irukudhu.
DHANASREE (thinking): Three more days... No. Only sixty-nine hours left...
  ta: Innum moonu naal… Illa. 69 hours dhaan iruku…
RAGUL (worried): Dhanasree, what's happening? Do you know something about this?
  ta: Dhanasree yenna nadakudhu? Unakku idha pathi yedachu theriyuma?
DHANASREE: To be honest... I don't know exactly.
  ta: Unmaiya sollanum-na… yennaku correct-ah therla.
@clue sixty_nine
@fx fade_out
@scene gen:hostel_room
@fx fade_in
@music sorrow
NARRATOR: Arun is packing his bag when his phone rings. "Nithish amma". His hands start to shake.
  ta: Arun bag pack pannitu irukumbodhu phone adikkudhu. "Nithish amma". Kai nadunga aarambikkudhu.
AMMA: Arun, can you hear me, pa? Where's Nithish? I called him four or five times; it just says switched off.
  ta: Arun, kekudha-pa? Nithish angaya pa irukan? Avan-uku naan naal-anju vaati adichan. Aana 'chuch-aap' nu vandhuchu.
ARUN: His phone must have run out of charge, amma. Don't worry. He's gone out with friends, on some project work. He'll be back.
  ta: Phone-la charge theendhu poirukum-ma, neenga onnum bayap-padadheenga. Avan yedho project velaiya poran-nu sonnan ma. Avan vandhuruvan.
AMMA: Ask him to call me as soon as he comes. Don't forget, pa. Look after yourself.
  ta: Sari avan vandha odaney yenakku adikka solriya? Marakkama koopda sollu-pa. Odamba pathuko.
ARUN: Yes, amma. I'll tell him.
  ta: Sari ma, kandippa solren.
NARRATOR: The lie sits heavy on him. Arun holds his head in both hands.
  ta: Andha poi avan mela baarama irukku. Arun rendu kaiyaalum thalaiya pudichukkuraan.
@scene gen:station
@music sorrow
@sfx door
NARRATOR: The cell door bangs shut. The sound echoes through Nithish's head.
  ta: Cell kadhavu "dhadaal"-nu moodudhu. Andha saththam Nithish thalaikulla edhirolikkudhu.
NITHISH (thinking): What now? Everything's slipping out of my hands. If there's no way out of this... that's it? My life ends here?
  ta: Ippo yenna panradhu? Yellamey yen kai meeri pogudhu… Oruvela idhula irundhu thappika valiye illana yenna pandradhu? Appo… avlodhana, yennoda vaazhka ingaye mudinjirucha…
NITHISH (thinking): No... I didn't do anything wrong. Why should I go to jail? Nothing will happen to me. God is there. He knows I did nothing.
  ta: Illa… Na yendha thappum pannala, na yen jail-ku ponum. Yenaku onnum aavadhu. Kadavul irukaru. Avaruku theriyum na thappu pannala-nu.
NITHISH (sad): Or maybe... this is just how my life was meant to end.
  ta: Oruvela… yen vaazhka ipdi-dhaan mudiyanum-nu iruku pola…
